Hello everyone, in this video, we will learn about the new feature of the 2024 version, the sewing wrinkle.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Sewing wrinkle is used to show the fine wrinkle caused by the difference in tension between the fabric and the sewing line.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
You can refer to this picture, the position of the sewing line or the line will have some effect of sewing wrinkle.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Sewing wrinkle is most commonly used to make cowboy clothes.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
If you look at these cowboy clothes on Kinect, you will see that there are all kinds of sewing wrinkle effects in the sewing line position.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Due to the different water washing effects on the clothes, the sewing wrinkle is either strong or weak.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Sewing wrinkle is not limited to cowboy clothing, but it can also be used for this kind of leisure clothing.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Although it can get a more real wrinkle effect by making the mesh grid smaller,

9
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,000
but using this kind of mesh grid or fabric pattern of sewing wrinkle can create a similar effect without changing the premise of the version.

